    <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      “OpenFray”, “we”, and “us” mean the operator of the Service: <strong>Nicola Mustone</strong>{
        ' '
      }(Romania), contactable at <a href="mailto:info@openfray.app">info@openfray.app</a>. “You”
