    </p>

    <h2>2. The Service</h2>
    <p>
      OpenFray is a free tool for running tabletop-game encounters — tracking initiative, resources,
      conditions, dice and reference material. It is offered as a convenience and may be changed,
      limited, or discontinued at any time. OpenFray is a scratchpad, not an authoritative system of
      record; you are responsible for keeping your own copies of anything important.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>The combat console is free to use, and will remain so.</strong> There is no paid tier, no
      advertising, and no feature of it reserved for payment; an account is free and adds nothing you
      have to buy. The same holds for the material we publish as free to read — the creature libraries
