      <li>place excessive automated load on the Service, or scrape it beyond ordinary use;</li>
      <li>upload unlawful, infringing, or malicious content;</li>
      <li>
        publish an encounter, a creature, a note, or a byline that is unlawful, hateful, sexual, or
        deceptive, or that impersonates another person or organization;
      </li>
      <li>
